author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: The parser has no unanchored scan; both branches of the segment lookup are covered by tests that exercise them; a long run of separators is pinned by test; the code scanning alert closes
risk: high
severity: high
repro_steps: Call the relation target parser with a long run of separator characters. The unanchored form retries the match at every position.
component: index.ts
close_reason: "Rewritten to extract the segment positionally and test it with an anchored pattern. Both lookup branches are reachable and covered, a sixty-four separator run is pinned, and the gate is green at 100 percent across statements, branches, functions and lines."
body: ""
